---
title: GitHub submission
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Open : submit
  state Open {
    [*] --> Pending
    Pending --> ChangesRequested : review asks for changes
    Pending --> ReviewApproved : review approves
    ChangesRequested --> Pending : resubmit
    ReviewApproved --> Pending : resubmit
  }
  state outcome <<choice>>
  Open --> outcome : status sync
  outcome --> Merged : merged
  outcome --> Closed : closed
  Open --> Withdrawn : withdraw
  Merged --> [*]
  Closed --> [*]
  Withdrawn --> [*]
